		2540 Polk Ave.
		San Diego, CA 92104

Thanks, again, and happy computing.  Oh, btw, I am available for hire in the
San Diego area as of this writing, so drop me a line if you want a Unix,
Novell, or DOS programmer or sysadmin. :^)

